WHITLING WOOD BECOMES WORK OF ART. / Marvelously delicate and complicated work made with noting but a jack-knife, by Mr. George W.Lockwood, shown at work on a plain stick of wood part of which has already submitted to the magic of his blade. Carving is his hobby, but he has turned out innumerable pieces of work from solid piece of wood that amaze artists and sculptors.
1/6/21 / WATCH YOUR CREDIT LINE;
PHOTO FROM: WIDE WORLD PHOTOS; / 20950 F.C.
